'''Ninja Girl Tomoe''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror (Gacha Event)|Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror]] gacha event. She was added in [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]] increases damage and freeze time and grants [[Strong Against]].

